      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Please submit any such communications to the office of the Executive Secretary in complete form, with two carbon copies of the original attached. One carbon copy will be retained in the files of the Mayor's Office, and the other returned to the Department submitting the letter, with indication of the action taken.",
